{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "face_state_1d",
    "description": "A staggered 1-D pair on 10 cells: h on the cell set x, U on the face set x_nodes (11 faces, face i the low face of cell i). dh[i] reads U[i] and U[i+1]; dU[f] reads h[f-1] and h[f] on interior faces, and the two wall faces are 0. Decomposed with x_nodes declared as the face set of x, a tile owning cells a..b owns faces a..b, plus face 11 when b = 10. Halo: h (1, 0) along x; U (0, 1) along x_nodes.",
    "authors": [
      "EarthSciAST test suite"
    ],
